<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - China Trader - (built 1984) 66,732 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $9.5 million.</p>
<p>Federal Matane - (built 1984) 28,214 dwt sold within Norway for $9.25 million on a charterfree basis.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions. --London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8071</p>
